==Restrictions==
Cat Deploy Cost: Only 750¢ or less

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~80 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Metal Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
It is an exact copy of [[Attack on Titanium (Insane)|Attack on Titanium]], albeit with a restriction in place. Due to the restriction, the player can no longer rely on expensive [[:Category:Anti-Metal Cats|anti-Metal cats]] such as [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] or [[Sakura Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sakura Sonic]], but can still use cheaper ones such as [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]].

Use high-stamina Cats that are [[:Category:Cats with Knockback Immunity|Immune to Knockback]] before the [[Metal Hippoe]] moves out of his base and stack them while sending out damage dealers. Immune to knockback is used for Super Metal Hippoe. [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]], [[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Puppetmaster]] and [[Consultant Cat (Special Cat)|Business Partner Cat]] are some good units that can help with defeating the stage along with meatshields such as [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]. Critical rate up combos such as [[Whale Digger (Combo)|Whale Digger]] and [[Miracle Performance (Combo)|Miracle Performance]] will also help with taking down the cyclone and the other enemies.

It is also possible to beat this level without killing a single enemy. Level up your worker cat to level 4, then send out 1 Crazed Tank. Level up your Worker Cat to level 6, then send everything out non-stop. Very easy if you do it fast enough.

